      "title": "Mass Times",
      "alias": "mass-times",
      "categoryId": "24",
      "categoryTitle": "Homepage Articles",
      "introtext": "\t<div class=\"mt-column\">\n<div>\n<h2>Weekend Mass</h2>\n<p>Saturday Vigil: 5:00pm<br />Sunday Morning: 9:00am &amp; 11:30am</p>\n<h2>Weekday Mass</h2>\n<p>Monday to Thursday: 9:30am</p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Weekly Devotions</strong></span><br />Morning Prayer Group: Thurs at 8:15am<br />Eucharistic Adoration: Thurs after 9:30am Mass<br />Benediction: 1st Thurs monthly after Adoration<br />Recitation of the Rosary:<br />   Mon 7:00pm | Tues 8:45am | Wed 9:00am<br />First Saturday Devotion: 9:00am Mass (Monthly)</p>\n</div>",
